#: ../../linux/nginx.rst:2
msgid "Nginx - 高性能 web 服务器"
msgstr "Nginx - High-Performance Web Server"

#: ../../linux/nginx.rst:4
msgid "`Nginx <http://nginx.org/>`_ （发音同engine x）是一款由俄罗斯程序员Igor Sysoev所开发轻量级的网页服务器、反向代理服务器以及电子邮件（IMAP/POP3）代理服务器。整体采用模块化设计是nginx的一个重大特点，甚至http服务器核心功能也是一个模块。要注意的是：nginx的模块是静态的，添加和删除模块都要对nginx进行重新编译，这一点与Apache的动态模块完全不同。"
msgstr "`Nginx <http://nginx.org/>`_ (pronounced like \"engine x\") is a lightweight web server, reverse proxy server, and email (IMAP/POP3) proxy server developed by Russian programmer Igor Sysoev. One of nginx's major characteristics is its overall modular design — even the core HTTP server functionality is a module. Note that nginx's modules are static: adding or removing modules requires recompiling nginx, which is completely different from Apache's dynamic modules."

